    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so if the electrostatic forces are weakening, is there a way to stabilize it by adjusting the lecithin concentration, or should i look into a different emulsifier altogether? like, would something like polysorbate 60 be more resilient to that acid level?",
